### 6. Streaming CDC with DBSQL (FLOW AUTO CDC)

For SQL-only streaming CDC without SDP Python decorators:

```sql
-- SCD Type 1 (latest state only)
CREATE OR REFRESH STREAMING TABLE silver.customers;

CREATE FLOW silver_customers_cdc AS
  INSERT INTO silver.customers
  BY AUTO CDC FROM STREAM bronze.customers_raw
  KEYS (customer_id)
  SEQUENCE BY event_timestamp
  STORED AS SCD TYPE 1;

-- SCD Type 2 (full history)
CREATE OR REFRESH STREAMING TABLE silver.customers_history;

CREATE FLOW silver_customers_history AS
  INSERT INTO silver.customers_history
  BY AUTO CDC FROM STREAM bronze.customers_raw
  KEYS (customer_id)
  SEQUENCE BY event_timestamp
  STORED AS SCD TYPE 2;
```

**Handling deletes:**
```sql
CREATE FLOW silver_customers_cdc AS
  INSERT INTO silver.customers
  BY AUTO CDC FROM STREAM bronze.customers_raw
  KEYS (customer_id)
  SEQUENCE BY event_timestamp
  DELETE WHEN operation = 'DELETE'
  STORED AS SCD TYPE 2;
```

