### 8. Full Architecture — CDC Pipeline

```
Source Database (MySQL/Postgres/Kafka)
    │
    │  Debezium / Kafka Connect / Lakeflow Connect
    ▼
┌───────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ BRONZE: Raw CDC Events (append-only)             │
│ Auto Loader / Kafka source                        │
│ Columns: key, value, operation, timestamp          │
│ Table type: Streaming Table                        │
├───────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ SILVER: apply_changes / FLOW AUTO CDC              │
│ SCD Type 1 or Type 2                               │
│ Deduped, ordered, clean                             │
│ CDF enabled for downstream                          │
├───────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ GOLD: Materialized Views / Aggregations             │
│ Reads from silver CDF — processes only changes      │
│ Pre-aggregated for dashboards                        │
└───────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

